REMOVAL REQUESTS
----------------

If you hold rights over any document reproduced here and want it removed, open an
issue on the project repository. Removal requests are honoured without argument: the
corpus is rebuildable from source URLs, so dropping a document costs the project a
manifest entry and nothing else.


NEUTRALITY
----------

This project takes no political position. Parties are covered by a uniform rule, and
the server is built to quote rather than to summarise. Coverage is uneven between
parties because the parties published unequal volumes in 2022; the server reports
that imbalance rather than correcting it by truncating anyone.
